libcCRT -- Compiler C Runtime Library

This library provides compiler intrinsics and runtime support functions for
multiple compilers including GCC, Clang, MSVC, and Open Watcom.

The cCRT library is part of the A•NUX Project and provides low-level compiler
support functionality that is independent of the operating system.

Features:
- Multi-compiler support (GCC, Clang, MSVC, Open Watcom)
- Compiler intrinsics (division, popcount, etc.)
- Portable builtin functions (clz, ctz, bswap, etc.)
- Architecture-specific optimizations

